{"sections":[{"slug":"拟范畴","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"拟范畴"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">拟范畴</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“拟范畴”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">拟范畴是一种用</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/单纯集","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">单纯集</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">建立的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/无穷范畴的模型","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">无穷范畴的模型</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">拟范畴是一种特殊的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/单纯集","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">单纯集</span>"}},{"Plain":" $C$, <span lang=\"zh\">满足弱</span> Kan <span lang=\"zh\">条件</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">即</span> $C$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的任意内角形</span> (inner horn) $\\Lambda_i^n \\to C (0&lt;i&lt;n)$ <span lang=\"zh\">都有填充</span> (filler). <span lang=\"zh\">等价的定义是</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">单纯集映射</span>\n$$\r\n\t[\\Delta^2,C] \\to [\\Lambda_1^2,C]\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">是无圈</span> Kan <span lang=\"zh\">纤维化</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">这个定义的直观是两个态射的所有复合方式可缩</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Kan复形","text":"Kan <span lang=\"zh\">复形</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">是拟范畴</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">范畴的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/脉","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">脉</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">是拟范畴</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}